This product includes software developed as part of an ECE-AI/ML assignment
for SkyServe, evaluating change detection on Sentinel-2 imagery.

Contains data and annotations derived from the Onera Satellite Change Detection
dataset (Daudt, Le Saux, Boulch, Gousseau, IGARSS 2018), used under the terms
stated in docs/report.md. Sentinel-2 imagery is Copernicus data.
